        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Final Phase Now on Sale\n\nPlease register your interest for future updates or contact Savills on 01 618 1300.\n\nThe Blossoms at Tandy's Lane is one of Evara's newest developments in the sought after location of Lucan, Co. Dublin.\n \nThe Heather is a 3 bedroom mid/end terrace house extending to approximately 110sqm across two floors. The accommodation briefly comprises of an entrance hallway leading to a generous living room to the front, guest W/C and kitchen to the rear with double doors leading to the garden. The beautifully designed kitchens are supplied by BeSpace and boast an island, calacatta gold quartz counter tops throughout and access to a generous utility room providing additional storage options. The first floor features three generously proportioned bedrooms including master ensuite, main bathroom, storage and easily accessible attic storage. \n\nWith every convenience and a wide array of amenities on your doorstep, The Blossoms is sure to appeal. This stunning new development is located in a vibrant and exciting neighbourhood situated just 16km west of Dublin City Centre with direct access to the city by road and rail in under 30 minutes. Adamstown Train station (which is located along the DART plus south-west expansion project) currently provides an excellent service to Park West, Heuston Station, Connolly Station, Pearse Street Station and Grand Canal Dock and is just 15 minutes' walk away. The city centre can be easily reached via the nearby N4, and Dublin Airport is a mere 25-minute drive via the M50. \n\nNew residents will be joining a friendly, well-established community which is surrounded by an array of facilities, from parks and schools to leisure and shopping facilities, Lucan has it all. The Blossoms is also ideally located just 10 minutes' walk from The Crossings, a new urban village with a mix of retail offerings including Tesco, Aldi, Urban Vets, The Grafton Barber, ABC Gym, and Belfry & Co Cafe. \n\nSerpentine Park is a large linear park located within the scheme, which provides a beautiful green space for everyone to enjoy. Located just across the road from the scheme is Tandy's Lane Park, a 19-acre park designed with a mix of recreation facilities for all ages. For sports enthusiasts, Sarsfield's GAA club, Lucan United Soccer Club and Weston Hockey club are all situated close by, as is the Hermitage and Lucan golf clubs. \n\nEducation is at the heart of this close-knit community with a wide variety of both primary and secondary schools within walking distance of the development. \n\nAll homes at The Blossoms will be A2 rated with high levels of insulation throughout, complimented by air to water heat pumps for heating and hot water, resulting in increased energy efficiency and sustainability. Each of the homes has been expertly designed by Mola Architects to offer residents a wide range of spacious, light filled homes to choose from. \n\nFor further information, please register your interest today at theblossoms.ie or contact Savills New Homes at 01 618 1300"
      },
